      "blocking": false,
      "reason": "The animal sense was labelled only US informal, omitting the word's extremely offensive racial slur sense.",
      "resolution": "Added an explicit serious racial-slur warning and restriction against using the word for people; retained the clearly animal-only striped-tail/tree context.",
      "sources": [
